  "limits": [
    "HSE 16/32/8MHz are software inputs written by 080108ac / 08010960, not measurements of a fitted oscillator.",
    "64MHz is the value the firmware would compute and store, conditional on PLL lock, a successful SW=2 switch with SWS readback 0x10, and no fatal error.",
    "The integer-division semantics of 08008174 come from its three quotient call sites; the helper itself was not formally proved.",
    "Nominal SysTick units assume the running core clock equals the stored clock variable and the interrupt is serviced normally.",
    "Static bytes do not prove PLL lock, switch transition, tick loss or interrupt latency."
  ],
